**W3-D2-Apps_and_URLs**

---

**What and Why:**
Django projects are split into apps — each app handles one specific feature. Your AI Job Portal will have separate apps for `users`, `jobs`, `applications`. Today you create your first app, write your first view (the function that handles a request and returns a response), and connect it to a URL. By end of today you'll see your own output in the browser — first real working Django code.

